<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>HISVIA 图片终审 — 8大品类134张</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC",sans-serif;background:#f0f2f5;color:#1a1a1a;padding:20px;line-height:1.5}
h1{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px}
.sub{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-bottom:12px}
.summary{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px}
.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px}
.stat b{font-size:18px;color:#1a6fb2}
.stat.ok b{color:#1a7a3a}
.stat.bad b{color:#c0392b}
.group{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.gh{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
.gh .cn{font-size:15px;font-weight:700}
.gh .cnt{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-left:auto}
.gh .num{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:2px}
.gh .num.ok{background:#1a7a3a}
.gh .num.bad{background:#c0392b}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:10px}
.c{border:2px solid;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
.c.ok{border-color:#1a7a3a33}
.c.bad{border-color:#c0392b33;opacity:0.6}
.c img{width:100%;height:160px;object-fit:contain;background:#fff;display:block;cursor:zoom-in;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
.c img.zoom{position:fixed;top:5%;left:5%;width:90%;height:auto;max-height:90vh;z-index:99}
.lb{padding:6px 8px;font-size:10px}
.lb .tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:3px;color:#fff}
.c.ok .tag{background:#1a7a3a}
.c.bad .tag{background:#c0392b}
.lb .desc{color:#444;font-size:11px}
.lb .wm{color:#c0392b;font-size:10px;margin-top:2px}
</style></head><body>
<h1>HISVIA 图片终审 — 8大品类 134张</h1>
<p class="sub">品牌整机35张(带品牌搜索) + 通用配件99张(不带品牌搜索) · qwen-vl-plus识图 · 400x400</p>
<div class="summary">
<div class="stat ok"><b>27</b> 品牌整机合格</div>
<div class="stat ok"><b>53</b> 通用配件合格</div>
<div class="stat bad"><b>54</b> 不合格(已剔除)</div>
<div class="stat"><b>80</b> 可用总数</div>
</div>
